      <h1>Where Are T-Shirts Manufactured? A Complete Guide to Global T-Shirt Production</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-06">October 6, 2026</time></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Ask "where are T-shirts manufactured?" and you are usually asking something narrower: which country should make <em>mine</em>? No single nation owns T-shirt production. The global map is a patchwork of industrial clusters, each built around a different mix of labor cost, cotton access, technical capability, and distance to the end market.</p>
